              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">aac7e3cd-03c8-4e95-a677-a2f700c6f7b7</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Description</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Surface temperatures for MRT from EnergyPlus, staged so the costly view factors are solved once.
Fidelity: Engineering - EnergyPlus surface heat balance, not validated for this site.
Method: MRT View Factors, then SurfaceTemp (EnergyPlus), then MRT Solve, for an Ithaca site from Site Context (buildings, tree crowns, terrain) with Ithaca weather.
Result: Surface temperatures and annual mean MRT at sensors 1.1 m off the building and ground surfaces.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; Comfort study (Radiance / EnergyPlus). Runtime: minutes to hours.
Edit: Working Directory (CHANGE-ME), site (Site Picker), station; click the three Run toggles in order.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="5">
