                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">2</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Mean radiant temperature (°C) at each selected hour — one branch per HOY, each holding every probe's value {hoy}(probe count). Populated ONLY when HOY is connected; with HOY unconnected this would be the entire year, which is the tree this component exists to avoid. Note that a large HOY list is inherently expensive: every value asked for here becomes an object on the canvas.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c1a26113-3bf1-4daa-b4b0-81bc27881209</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">MRT</item>
